  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.5:\n- DOCS: Comprehensive documentation update with accurate implementation examples and best practices.\n- Improved developer experience with copy-paste ready code samples.\n\nv1.3.4:\n- FEATURE: Expose matched issuer/provider via HttpContext.GetMatchedIssuer() and inject provider claims for downstream responses.\n- DOCS: Clarified Azure AD client_credentials issuer format (sts.windows.net) vs v2.0 and added guidance/examples.",
